{"text": "1\n\n0.\n\nml.\n\nIV.\n\nOVERALL EXPERIENCE\n\n\u2018\u00a9 Been involved for 1-3 months - was it what you expected?\n\nDid you try to adjust to the product? Was it easy/hard to adjust?\nHow much did you smoke? What % of total?\u201d\n\nPRODUCT DISCUSSION\n\nOverall, what did you like about the product?\nWere there any new benefits to the product you didn't know about?\n\u2018What do you dislike about the product? How big of a deal is it?\nDiscuss major product areas: taste (strong, weak), puffs, heat, consistency,\nsatisfaction, didn't know it's over, etc.\nHave you adjusted to the product? Why not? How hard was it?\n= (Among neutral/rejecters) Would you keep trying to adjust if you had\nmore time or is it just not going to work for you?\n\nREACTIONS OF OTHERS\n\nHow many did you show product to? What forum? What did you say to them?\nWhat reaction (probe NS versus S)?\n\u2018Smoker reaction after trial?\nOverall, if you were walking around smoking these, do you feel you would\nreceive positive/negative feedback from others, e.g., is it a good thing to be\nseen with the product?\n\nPURCHASE INTEREST, ETC.\n\nReview scales at back of Diary.\nShould this product be sold soon? Why/why not?\n\nA. Rejecters/Neutral\n\n= What are you going to do if the product doesn't change after 3 months of effort?\n\nWhat do you say to someone about this experience?\n\nB. Among Acceptors\n= Assume this product is for sale, would you go looking for it or only buy it if\n\nyou see it at the store?\n. What if it were only for sale at one chain (e.g., Ingles?)\n. What about via mail only?\nProbe what they would say in a testimonial - write a couple sentences.\n\nnaaess\n\nv6TO 6tETS", "words": [{"text": "1", "x0": 96, "y0": 223, "x1": 104, "y1": 234, "conf": 34.0}, {"text": "0.", "x0": 92, "y0": 314, "x1": 101, "y1": 325, "conf": 42.0}, {"text": "ml.", "x0": 90, "y0": 496, "x1": 108, "y1": 507, "conf": 41.0}, {"text": "IV.", "x0": 91, "y0": 642, "x1": 106, "y1": 653, "conf": 81.